    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03045",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "源氏看了这回信，笑道：“我从来不曾听说这位大将也会写这种潇洒的信。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Genji read the reply and laughed, saying, \"I had never heard that this general could write such a stylish letter.",
          "g": "predicate"
