    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03045",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "但他心中非常痛恨髭黑大将独占玉鬘。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But in his heart he bitterly resented General Higekuro for keeping Tamakazura all to himself.",
